REMARK   1 elements.pdb -- one atom of every element in pdb2pov's ELEMENTS table.
REMARK   1 Laid out on a grid so a render shows the whole palette at once.
REMARK   1 Used by 'make check' to prove the table in pdb2pov.c and the
REMARK   1 declarations in atoms2.inc / atoms_glass2.inc / the radius includes
REMARK   1 stay in step: a missing declaration fails the render loudly.
